    "body": "## DUNCAN PRIME — FIRST RESULT NIGHT PREFLIGHT / RUN 06\n\n**RESULT**\n- Fresh state restored before action.\n- `main = b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1`.\n- `duncan/zorr-studio-r01 = f67fd9454a6c2702e60b270634d934dc2ea62665`.\n- #249 remains the character-mechanics workstream; #250 remains downstream PREP-only; #251 remains MASTER gate control.\n- PR #252 fresh-read remains `OPEN / DRAFT / NOT MERGED`, head `bfd693fa563a5fba7869ee5adabe23a9d9ce5aec`; no SHERIFF mutation was made.\n- OWNER W01..W06 visual authorization remains durable in #248.\n\n**DELTA**\n- Re-tested direct raw-file materialization of the two frozen accepted Library refs:\n  - suit turnaround `file_0000000004f882469dfa7a8b272ac5c4`\n  - costume/accessory `file_0000000037b4821082deb5afcb57227e`\n- Both still fail closed because those IDs are not visible on the current Files surface; no substitute ref was accepted.\n- Expanded hash-first recovery into an older 2026-08-30 Library image layer and physically materialized four previously untested candidates.\n- Fresh SHA256 results:\n  - `02_a185cd81-3700-49eb-957e-4a3c353e4d7d(3).png` -> `4e49ef4f3a6ee15f81a542371f2b2ec6ef03f1d41a07c0d8d132d3bbc55c3f6f`\n  - `44ebca51-df47-4c1f-a20a-d0354dc3fdf1.png` -> `756ac71ce9e70c00326f66d2ea51077a5eb00a8b144032121549981a94d30b33`\n  - `6bafb2d7-ac90-4478-9c4c-f5040e62959d.png` -> `578a81d942815655e1340d539e951ba93ee9c0e0e00cd4193baa48db4edf0302`\n  - `e29f332e-fb5e-4bdf-887c-a49ed5feb686.png` -> `e46500327318d17b0e2413905a817bd270680ff9909afb56c49e4dd080ef67ee`\n- None matches frozen C00 authority hashes `94c185aea5755e569f8359fd29c6e0b8a1748e1613f2b59e7a3e280205dcbc8e` (C00-A costume/accessory) or `49f1c5fa9973f185c4ed7441325e2705d392449f6d59b4592ec6d81bc4b4da82` (C00-D body turnaround). These four paths are now excluded by bytes, not appearance.\n\n**EVIDENCE**\n- Durable C00 authority document still identifies C00-A and C00-D by the hashes above.\n- Current Library listing exposes the four